{
  "UniqueID": "water_sawmill_ore_sluice_placed",
  "CardName": {
    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_ore_sluice_placed",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_OreSluicePlaced_CardName",
    "DefaultText": "Ore Sluice"
  },
  "CardDescription": {
    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_ore_sluice_placed",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_OreSluicePlaced_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "A water-powered sluice box for washing soil and separating mineral deposits. Load mud piles, dirt piles, or fine dirt, then run the sluice to process them for greenstone, flint, stone, and occasionally metal nuggets."
  },
  "CardHelpSection": {
    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_ore_sluice_placed",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_OreSluicePlaced_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Operation:</b> Load mud piles, dirt piles, or fine dirt into the sluice, then press Sluice All. Each drop is rolled independently: a single pile can yield several items, and a pile whose rolls all miss leaves a Stone behind.\n\nDrop chances (Mud / Dirt / Fine Dirt):\nIron Nugget: 1% / 0.5% / 0.25%\nCopper Nugget: 2% / 1% / 0.5%\nTin Nugget: 1% / 0.5% / 0.25%\nGreenstone: 3% / 2% / 1%\nFlint: 30% / 20% / 10%\nStone: 40% / 20% / 10%\nClay: 10% / 20% / 55%\n\nNuggets spawn at 35% quality.\n\n<b>Time:</b> Sluice All takes 45 minutes.\n\n<b>Overshot Wheel:</b> Drag an Overshot Wheel onto the sluice to fit it (30 minutes): Sluice All then takes 15 minutes. Pack Up (Overshot) packs the sluice and gives the wheel back."
  },
